# Translation note

This file is generated by replacing the Russian README's prose with an English
translation of the same sections. Every claim, table, and link is preserved 1:1
with `README.ru.md`.

The Spanish, German, French, Chinese and Japanese READMEs follow the same
structure: same sections, same tables, same numbers.

If a section cannot be translated truthfully (for example a local-market price
that only makes sense in som), the translation says so explicitly rather than
inventing a figure.

Source labels are preserved verbatim and explained in each README:
**[measured]**, **[reported]**, **[inferred]**, **[panel]**.